[PASS] (4) every codeword of C(H) has EVEN total weight (inf coordinate is an overall parity check -- matches the literature's extension)
[PASS] (4) puncturing C(H) at inf gives exactly <theta>
(x^p-1)/(x+1) factors into irreducibles of degrees [3, 3]
GF(2^3) = GF(2)[y]/(x^3 + x + 1),  alpha = y
