[PASS] equivalence: coordinate map j -> 3*j (inf fixed) maps ext(N) onto ext(Q)
weight distribution of C(H): {0: 1, 4: 14, 8: 1}
[PASS] dim C(H) = (p+1)/2 = 4
[PASS] self-dual: dim = n/2 and all basis inner products even
[PASS] doubly even (all weights = 0 mod 4) => Type II for p = -1 mod 8
[PASS] p=7: C(H) is the [8,4,4] code e8-hat, wd {0:1,4:14,8:1}

